  m_Name: Customer_mage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SproutOfDebt.Shop.CustomerData
  displayName: Apprentice Mage
  neutral: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 167452d34c8747f29ce6241250e57d45, type: 3}
  happy: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 41955e2170f1400786117484bb23858e, type: 3}
  disappointed: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fcc8cd8038864591958fcc5d06469a32, type: 3}
  stories:
  - potion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 387b60560a6875448b61d4d63aba9d69, type: 2}
    lines:
    - My final exam is tomorrow and my hands won't stop shaking. Last time I panicked, I turned my teacher's beard into moss. Never again!
  - potion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 32930a2f26bc159479195a92f90f6ac0, type: 2}
    lines:
    - Master wants me to copy star charts on the tower roof all night. I can barely see the ink by moonlight... literally.
  - potion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 70b391c0507088648b7784764b44dc43, type: 2}
    lines:
    - Someone keeps stealing my spell notes. Tonight I'll hide in the library shadows and catch them red-handed!
  - potion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f56d0e854410b4143b7def29147754b8, type: 2}
    lines:
    - I'm practising fire spells, but my sparks keep fizzling out. Master says a warm brew will help the flame catch.
  - potion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d6bd3f10682f8124eb003c8440e95252, type: 2}
    lines:
    - I tried a levitation spell on myself and... landed on the roof. Well, through the roof. My ankle hurts so much.
  requestLines:
  - So, um... could I please get...
  - C-can you help me? I need...
  thanksLines:
  - Thank you! Master will be so pleased!
  disappointedLines:
  - Oh no... I'll be scolded again.
